    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Niall Browne & Company are delighted to present No. 190 Gort na Coiribe to the market — a superbly located three-bedroom ground floor apartment within one of Galway city’s most established and sought-after residential developments. Occupying a convenient ground floor position with level access, the property offers bright, well-proportioned accommodation ideally suited to,  or investors seeking a strong and convenient  location where acesss and demand is consistently high. Accommodation extends to three bedrooms — the master with its own en-suite — along with a main bathroom, and a generous open-plan living space with double doors opening to a private patio. Gort na Coiribe is a mature, professionally managed scheme set close to the banks of the River Corrib, just off the Headford Road on the city’s north side. Residents enjoy landscaped communal grounds and a genuinely walkable setting — the University of Galway, University Hospital Galway and Terryland Retail Park are all close at hand, with the shops and restaurants of Galway city centre only a short stroll away. Early viewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate both the accommodation on offer and the outstanding location."
      },
